UPDATE companies SET description='The company began producing specialized woven webbing, tapes, and specialty fabrics for critical-use applications.

BRM designs, develops, and manufactures a range of woven products including narrow tapes, webbing, seamless tubular materials, 2-D and 3-D structural shapes, braided structures, and multi-layer complex fabrics. Production methods encompass shuttle looms, needle looms, Jacquard looms, braiding equipment, and specialty broadlooms capable of widths up to 72 inches. Post-weave processes include dyeing, finishing (heat setting, resin treating, PTFE, silicone, flame retardant), strap cutting, hole punching, and sonic welding. The facility supports prototype through full-scale production runs.

The company serves aerospace, defense, medical (Class I–III devices, orthopedic, prosthetic, and dental biotextiles), safety (firefighting protective clothing per NFPA and Canadian standards), automotive, commercial, industrial, and composites markets. Customers include OEMs, medical device manufacturers, defense contractors, and safety equipment suppliers requiring Berry Amendment–compliant materials.

The quality system is certified to ISO 9001:2015, AS9100D, and ISO 13485:2016, with TS 16949 compliance for automotive customers.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','AS9100D','ISO 13485:2016','TS 16949 compliance','Berry Amendment compliance']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Narrow woven tape and webbing", "Seamless tubular woven materials", "2-Dimensional woven shapes", "3-Dimensional interlocking angles", "Braided structures (flat, biaxial, triaxial, T/J shapes, mandrel over-braids)", "Multi-layer and complex woven shapes", "Uni-directional fabrics", "Shuttle loom weaving", "Needle loom (shuttleless) weaving", "Jacquard loom weaving (CAD-controlled)", "Specialty broadloom weaving (up to 72-inch width)", "Yarn dyeing, batch dyeing, continuous dyeing", "Finishing: heat setting, scouring, resin treating, PTFE, silicone, latex, waterproof, flame treat, anti-fungal, pre-shrinking", "Strap cutting, custom length sealing, hole punching, sonic welding", "Prototyping and fabrication", "Product design and engineering", "Quality testing: tensile, elongation, color fastness, abrasion", "First article inspection (AS9102)", "FMEA, Control Plans, IQ-OQ-PQ, Process/Product Validation", "Lean/Six Sigma continuous improvement"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Defense", "Medical (Class I, II, III devices)", "Orthopedic, prosthetic, and dental biotextiles", "Safety (firefighting protective clothing)", "Automotive", "Commercial", "Industrial", "Composites"], "materials": ["Nylon", "Polyester", "Aramid (Kevlar\u00ae, Nomex\u00ae)", "Graphite", "Glass", "Quartz", "Ceramic", "Silicon carbide", "Textured nylon"], "equipment": ["Shuttle looms", "Needle looms (shuttleless looms)", "Jacquard looms (CAD-controlled)", "Braiding machines", "Specialty broadlooms (up to 72-inch width)", "Spectrophotometers for color matching", "In-house quality testing lab (tensile, elongation, abrasion, colorfastness)"], "volume": "Prototype to full-scale production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "b