UPDATE companies SET description='Barrington Wood Works LLC was established in April 2018 in Lake Barrington, Illinois. The company operates from its Lake Barrington facility where it handles fabrication and finishing for custom millwork projects.

The shop provides custom millwork design, shop drawings, CNC machining, factory finishing, millwork fabrication, installation, and field touch‑up services. It also offers semi‑custom cabinetry and pre‑installs projects to simplify final installation. All fabrication and finishing are performed in‑house at the Lake Barrington location.

Barrington Wood Works emphasizes high‑quality craftsmanship and materials coupled with quick turnaround times. The business was founded to deliver professional‑level shop drawings and finish work for any custom millwork project, positioning itself as a direct partner for design professionals and property owners.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom Millwork Design", "Shop Drawings", "CNC Machining", "Factory Finishing", "Millwork Fabrication", "Millwork Installation", "Field Touch Ups", "Hand Scraping", "Faux Finishes", "Semi-custom Cabinetry"], "industries": ["Custom Millwork", "Commercial Construction", "Residential Construction"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["CNC"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Fabrication and finishing completed in-house at Lake Barrington facility", "Projects pre\u2011installed to streamline final installation", "Quick turnaround on custom millwork orders", "Shop drawings produced for any project requirement", "Semi\u2011custom cabinetry available alongside full custom work"], "facts_used": ["Established April 2018 -> /", "Headquarters Lake Barrington, Illinois -> db", "Custom millwork design, shop drawings, CNC, factory finishing, millwork fabrication, installation, field touch-ups -> /", "Fabrication and finishing done in Lake Barrington location -> /", "Preinstallation of projects for easier final installation -> /", "Semi-custom cabinetry offered -> /", "Serves Greater Chicagoland area (list of cities) -> /", "Works with clients, designers, architects directly -> /", "Quick turnaround emphasized -> /", "Highest quality craftsmanship and materials claimed -> /", "Capabilities from DB: Millwork Fabrication, Hand scraping, machining and Faux finishes -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Our Custom Millwork has the fabrication and finishing done in our Lake Barrington location.", "founded_year": "2018", "employee_count": "", "cage