UPDATE companies SET description='Basic E Inc. operates from Charlotte, Vermont, where it maintains a 34,000‑square‑foot warehouse. The company describes itself as a unique distributor of electronic components, electrical parts, and industrial items, with franchised lines that carry certificates of compliance and full traceability. (No founding year or ownership details are disclosed.)

Beyond distribution, it offers repair services for industrial equipment, custom cable and harness assembly built to customer specifications, and an asset‑recovery program that purchases excess new inventory outright for cash.

Its customer base includes more than 35 nuclear power plants and electric generating utilities, along with military and defense buyers seeking MIL‑SPEC parts. The company also serves general industrial markets needing motors, valves, relays, circuit boards, semiconductors, and a broad range of electrical and electronic components.

