UPDATE companies SET description='Bauman Custom Woodworking was founded in 1995 in Salem, Ohio, by Stuart Bauman. What began as a woodworking hobby for friends and neighbors grew into a full-time operation by 1994, and the company formally launched the following year. Bauman remains the owner and leads a shop that serves homeowners throughout Northeast Ohio.

The shop produces custom cabinetry for kitchens, bathrooms, and standalone furniture pieces. Cabinets are built with solid‑wood face frames and veneer‑core plywood, while doors and drawers use solid‑wood components. The team handles design using 3D visualization, fabrication, finishing, and on‑site installation, delivering completed projects rather than factory‑standard boxes.

Customers are primarily residential clients in the Northeast Ohio region, including homeowners undertaking kitchen remodels, bathroom upgrades, or custom furniture commissions. Testimonials reference coordination with general contractors and stone fabricators such as Creative Construction & Design and Youngstown Granite & Quartz, indicating the shop works alongside other trades on larger renovations.

Bauman emphasizes that every project is handcrafted in‑house, avoiding factory constraints by tailoring each piece to the client’s exact specifications. The company’s stated goal is to use its craftsmanship to glorify God and benefit clients, a philosophy that drives its focus on personalized design and direct communication throughout the process.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cabinetry design", "Cabinet building", "Finishing", "Installation", "3D design visualization", "Custom furniture building", "Kitchen cabinet fabrication", "Bath vanity fabrication"], "industries": ["Residential cabinetry", "Kitchen and bath remodeling", "Custom furniture"], "materials": ["Solid wood", "Veneer-core plywood", "Cherry wood"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Handcrafted in\u2011house construction, not outsourced", "Custom design tailored to each client, no factory standards", "3D design visualization for project planning", "Full\u2011service installation by the company\u2019s own team", "Solid\u2011wood face frames and veneer\u2011core plywood construction"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1995 -> db", "Headquarters Salem, Ohio -> db", "Founder Stuart Bauman -> /about", "Custom cabinetry for kitchen, bath, furniture -> /", "Solid wood face frames and veneer-core plywood -> /", "3D design visualization -> /about", "Installation services -> /services", "Serves Northeast Ohio -> /about", "Handcrafted construction -> /about", "Custom design without factory standards -> /about", "Cherry wood used in project -> /about", "Coordination with general contractors and stone fabricators -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We offer custom cabinetry for various rooms in the home. From Kitchen Cabinets, to Bath Vanities to Custom Furniture", "founded_year": "1995", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "s