UPDATE companies SET description='Bayne Custom Woodworking operates from a 20-by-25-foot outbuilding in Mt. Juliet, Tennessee, just east of Nashville. After a career in IT and a 2009 move from Upstate New York, Bayne established a dedicated shop in Tennessee and, at his wife’s urging, left his computer role on March 12, 2021 to pursue woodworking full time.

The shop produces custom furniture piece by piece: dining tables, kitchen islands, mid-century sideboards, cabinets, bookshelves, and live-edge slabs, plus outdoor Adirondack chairs, garden benches, and planters made from Tennessee red cedar. Smaller runs include chess boards, cutting boards, recipe stands, and children’s blocks. Every project begins with a Sketchup 3D drawing for client approval. Lumber—maple, oak, walnut, cherry, alder, poplar, and cedar—is hand-selected from local mills and milled in-house on a jointer and planer before being finished with hand-wiped polyurethane or tung oil.

The shop also takes on “preserving memories” projects that incorporate wood from a client’s own old furniture or salvaged lumber.

The transition from a basement shop to a dedicated outbuilding allowed him to take on more complex projects while maintaining a one-at-a-time pace.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture design and build", "Furniture restoration and renewal", "Live-edge furniture", "Outdoor cedar furniture", "Custom wood milling and preparation", "3D design (Sketchup)", "Hand-finishing (hand-wiped poly, Tung oil)"], "industries": ["Residential custom furniture", "Furniture restoration", "Live-edge woodworking", "Outdoor furniture", "Small wood products"], "materials": ["Maple", "Red Oak", "White Oak", "Walnut", "Cherry", "Alder", "Poplar", "Tennessee Red Cedar"], "equipment": ["Table saw", "Band saw", "Jointer", "Planer", "Disk sander", "Sketchup 3D design software"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Every project starts with a detailed Sketchup drawing", "Lumber hand-picked from local Tennessee mills and milled in-house", "One-of-a-kind pieces built to exact customer specifications", "Restoration and renewal of heirloom furniture using original wood", "Outdoor cedar furniture sealed with tung oil for Tennessee climate"], "facts_used": ["Location: Mt. Juliet, Tennessee -> db", "Owner: Roger Bayne -> /about", "Full-time transition date: March 12, 2021 -> /about", "Shop size: 20'' x 25'' outbuilding -> /about", "Move from New York: 2009 -> /about", "Early woodworking from necessity using pallet wood -> /about", "Products: custom furniture, live-edge, outdoor cedar, small items -> /, /services", "Process: Sketchup 3D design, local lumber sourcing, in-house milling, hand finishing -> /, /services", "Materials: maple, red oak, white oak, walnut, cherry, alder, poplar, Tennessee red cedar -> /services", "Equipment: table saw, band saw, jointer, planer, disk sander -> /about", "Clientele: residential, Middle Tennessee -> /, /services", "Restoration services: heirloom renewal, incorporating old wood -> /, /services", "Dif