UPDATE companies SET description='Bazen Woodworking operates from Corsica, South Dakota, where owner and master craftsman Steve Bazen has been building custom cabinets and fine woodwork for over two decades. What began as a personal passion for woodworking grew into a dedicated shop serving families across the state.

The company produces custom kitchens, closet systems, built-in storage, and bathroom vanities, all handcrafted in its Corsica workshop. The process moves from consultation and design through fabrication to professional installation, with Steve overseeing every step. To date, the shop has completed more than 150 projects.

Bazen Woodworking serves residential clients throughout South Dakota, including homeowners in Mitchell, Corsica, and Sioux Falls. Projects range from modern kitchen range hoods and custom bar cabinets to built-in window seats and LED-lit bathroom vanities.

The business emphasizes direct communication—clients work solely with Steve from start to finish—along with premium materials, time-tested techniques, and attention to every joint and finish. Local knowledge of regional styles and building conditions further shapes each project.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cabinet making", "Kitchen cabinet design and fabrication", "Closet system design and fabrication", "Built-in storage fabrication", "Bathroom vanity fabrication", "Finish carpentry", "Wood finishing", "Project consultation and design", "Professional installation"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Home remodeling", "Interior design", "Cabinetry"], "materials": ["Wood"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Work directly with Steve from design to installation", "Handcrafted in Corsica, SD workshop", "Over 20 years of woodworking experience", "150+ completed projects", "Premium materials and time-tested techniques"], "facts_used": ["Location: Corsica, South Dakota -> /", "Owner: Steve Bazen -> /about", "Over 20 years experience -> /", "150+ projects completed -> /about", "Services: custom kitchens, closet systems, built-ins, bathroom vanities -> /", "Process: consultation, crafting, installation -> /", "Workshop in Corsica, SD -> /about", "Direct client interaction with Steve -> /about", "Clients in Mitchell, Corsica, Sioux Falls -> /", "Premium materials, time-tested techniques -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Every cabinet, every shelf, every piece of custom woodwork is crafted right here in our Corsica, South Dakota workshop.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='bazen-woodworking' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Beacon Metal Fabricators was founded in 1987 in Cleveland, Ohio, with a straightforward mission: do solid work, treat people right, and make things that last. The company began as a shop willing to take on the custom, short-run metal fabrication jobs that larger manufacturers often decline.

Today Beacon operates as a full-service metal fabrication partner, offering laser cutting, CNC bending, TIG/MIG/Stick welding, rolling and forming, wire fabrication, resistance and spot welding, fastener insertion, custom tool and fixture building, and in-house finishing including grinding, polishing, and painting. The shop specializes in prototype and low-volume production — typically dozens of parts rather than thousands — and works primarily in aluminum, stainless steel, and carbon steel.

Its customer base spans transportation prototyping and aftermarket automotive parts, electrical contractors needing custom enclosures for retrofit projects in hospitals and schools, architectural and lighting restoration for historic buildings such as churches and municipal facilities, public art and structural fabrication, and general industrial and commercial clients requiring one-off repairs or specialty builds.

Beacon distinguishes itself by embracing the "odd jobs" that bigger shops turn away, emphasizing a nimble, craftsmanship-driven approach over rigid processes. The company states that its size allows quick pivots and adaptability to tough requests, and it backs every part with a quality standard that often exceeds customer specifications, even without formal ISO or ITAR certifications.', certifications=ARRAY['UL standards','NSF standards','NAEF standards']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Laser Cutting", "CNC Bending", "Welding (TIG, MIG, Stick)", "Rolling & Forming", "Wire Fabrication", "Resistance & Spot Welding", "Fastener Insertion", "Machine & Tool Building", "Finishing (Grinding, Polishing, Painting, Powder Coating, Plating)"], "industries": ["Transportation & Prototyping", "Aftermarket Automotive", "Electrical Contractors", "Architectural & Lighting Restoration", "Public Art & Structural Fabrication", "Industrial & Commercial"], "materials": ["Aluminum", "Stainless Steel", "Carbon Steel"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to small-volume (dozens of parts)", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Short-run and prototype focus (dozens of parts, not thousands)", "Full-service capabilities under one roof: laser cutting, CNC bending, welding, forming, finishing", "Takes on complex one-offs and \"odd jobs\" that larger shops decline", "In-house finishing with grinding, polishing, painting and partner powder coating/plating", "Designs and builds custom tools, jigs, and fixtures to support production"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1987 in Cleveland, Ohio -> /about", "Mission: do solid work, treat people right, make things that last -> /about", "Full-service capabilities: laser cutting, CNC bending, welding (TIG/MIG/Stick), rolling/forming, wire fabrication, resistance/spot welding, fastener insertion, machine/tool building, finishing -> /", "Specializes in prototype and low-volume production (dozens of parts) -> /", "Materials: aluminum, stainless steel, carbon steel -> /", "Industries served: transportation prototyping, aftermarket automotive, electrical contractors (custom enclosures for hospitals/schools), architectural/lighting restoration (churches, municipal buildings), public art, industrial/commercial -> /about", "Differentiators: nimble approach, takes on odd jobs, quality exceeds specs, no formal ISO/ITAR -> /, /about", "Manufactures to UL, NSF, NAEF standards -> /about", "Company type: custom metal fabrication shop -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Beacon Metal Fabricators is Cleveland''s go-to shop for custom and specialty fabrication solutions.", "founded_year": "1987", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='beacon-metal-fabricators' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1983 in Waterloo, Iowa, Beals Sheet Metal has grown into one of the most diversified sheet metal fabricators in Northeast Iowa. The company operates two facilities in the Cedar Valley region and serves commercial, industrial, and residential clients.

The shop provides custom heavy metal fabrication including cutting, bending, welding, and machining. Equipment includes an automated plasma layout table, a heavy-gauge shear capable of 1/4-inch steel, and multiple press brakes. They stock stainless steel, aluminum, black iron, perforated and galvanized metals, and steel tubing. Products range from ventilation hoods, dust collectors, and ductwork to carts, cabinets, and custom parts and containers. The company also acts as a commercial HVAC contractor, handling design, new construction, and remodels.

Customers include individual consumers, small shops, and major manufacturers across the Cedar Valley and surrounding areas. The company works with business owners and engineers on projects of all sizes, from single custom pieces to full production runs.

