UPDATE companies SET description='Benco Equipment, headquartered in Bismarck, North Dakota, has served automotive professionals and hobbyists since 1972. The company operates as a family‑owned, six‑location network across the Midwest and functions as a division of Automotive Parts Headquarters Inc. (APH), a third‑generation family‑owned aftermarket parts distributor founded in 1920 as National Bushing & Parts Company in Minneapolis. APH today supports nearly 300 Auto Value stores and employs over 1,800 people across nine states.

Benco sells, installs, inspects, repairs and finances a broad range of automotive service equipment. Its product lineup includes vehicle lifts (light, medium and heavy‑duty, in‑ground, scissor and mobile), air compressors (piston and rotary screw), tire changers and wheel balancers, A/C machines from Robinair and MAHLE, waste‑oil heaters, piping systems in aluminum, stainless steel, copper and galvanized steel, lubrication systems, paint booths, Tommy Gate hydraulic lifts and exhaust systems. Each of the six branches – in Bismarck and West Fargo, ND; Eau Claire, WI; Hopkins and St. Cloud, MN; and Sioux Falls, SD – stocks a deep inventory of lifts, parts and maintenance supplies, backed by factory‑trained technicians who handle installation, mobile repair and on‑site inspection.

The customer base spans independent repair shops, dealership service departments, tire retailers, heavy‑duty fleet operators and motorcycle/ATV specialists throughout the Upper Midwest. Benco also serves hobbyists and DIY enthusiasts through its public‑access locations, offering financing options and a finance calculator on its website.

The company emphasizes its regional scale – “we sell and service more equipment than anyone in the region” – and its commitment to compliance, with inspection specialists following the current ANSI/ALI ALOIM standard. Its differentiation rests on a combination of extensive local stock, manufacturer‑trained service teams, and the backing of APH’s nine‑state distribution network.', certifications=ARRAY['ANSI/ALI ALOIM']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Installation of lifts and hoists (all makes and models)", "Installation of tire equipment (changers, balancers)", "Installation of air compressors (piston, rotary screw)", "Installation of piping systems (aluminum, stainless steel, copper, galvanized)", "Installation of lubrication systems", "Installation of paint booths", "Installation of Tommy Gate hydraulic lifts", "Installation of exhaust systems (above ground, in\u2011ground)", "Installation of waste oil heaters", "Parts and repair for lifts and hoists", "Parts and repair for pressure washers", "Parts and repair for battery chargers", "Parts and repair for Robinair and MAHLE A/C machines", "Parts and repair for tire changers and balancers", "Parts and repair for air compressors", "Parts and repair for waste oil heaters", "Inspection of lifts and hoists per ANSI/ALI ALOIM", "Inspection of tire equipment", "Inspection of Robinair and MAHLE A/C machines", "Inspection of waste oil heaters", "Training for lifts & hoists", "Training for tire equipment", "Training for other equipment", "Financing options"], "industries": ["Automotive service", "Automotive repair", "Tire service", "Heavy\u2011duty equipment", "Industrial equipment", "Motorcycle and ATV service"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Vehicle lifts (automotive, heavy\u2011duty, industrial, motorcycle/ATV, in\u2011ground, scissor, mobile)", "Air compressors (piston, rotary screw)", "Tire changers", "Wheel balancers", "A/C machines (Robinair, MAHLE)", "Waste oil heaters", "Piping systems (aluminum, stainless st