UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1982 in Paterson, New Jersey, Bennett Plastics is a family-owned and operated custom plastic injection molding company. Located just minutes from New York City, the business began as a local manufacturer and has grown to serve customers nationwide from its 36,000-square-foot facility.

The company provides a full range of in-house services including custom plastic injection molding, 3D printing and prototyping, product development and design for manufacturing, injection mold making, and finishing and packaging. Its Paterson facility produces millions of parts annually, supported by a team of experienced professionals across operations, engineering, quality, and production.

Bennett Plastics serves diverse industries such as baby products, food service, consumer goods, health and beauty, electrical, industrial products, and pharmaceutical. The company works with clients from initial concept through full-scale production, tailoring solutions to each sector''s requirements.

The company differentiates itself by keeping all manufacturing on-site with no outsourcing, enabling direct communication, strict quality control, and fast delivery. Its Fast-Track Mold Insert Program can deliver molded samples in as little as five weeks. A zero-defects quality objective, adherence to OSHA and Good Manufacturing Practices, and a sustainability focus using eco-friendly materials and waste reduction further define its approach.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom plastic injection molding", "3D printing and prototyping", "Product development and design for manufacturing", "Injection mold making", "Finishing services", "Packaging and delivery", "Fast-Track Mold Insert Program"], "industries": ["Baby products", "Food service", "Consumer goods", "Health and beauty", "Electrical industry", "Industrial products", "Pharmaceutical"], "materials": ["Plastics (including bio-based, biodegradable, and recycled)", "Metals"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to high-volume production (millions of parts annually)", "lead_time": "5 weeks for Fast-Track mold insert samples", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["All manufacturing performed in-house with no outsourcing", "Fast-Track Mold Insert Program delivering samples in as little as 5 weeks", "Family-owned and operated since 1982", "Zero-defects quality objective with rigorous in-process checks", "Sustainability focus using bio-based, biodegradable, and recycled materials"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1982 -> /about", "Family-owned and operated -> /", "36,000 sq ft facility -> /", "Millions of parts annually -> /", "In-house manufacturing, no outsourcing -> /about", "Fast-Track Mold Insert Program 5 weeks -> /capabilities", "Industries served: baby products, food service, consumer goods, health & beauty, electrical, industrial, pharmaceutical -> /about", "Materials: plastics and metals -> /", "Team members listed -> /about", "Sustainability focus -> /about", "Zero defects quality objec