UPDATE companies SET description='Big Horn Food Services operates from Cody, Wyoming, where it has served the Big Horn Basin since the 1970s. It began as a supplier of restaurant and janitorial essentials and has expanded into a broad-line distributor for foodservice and retail customers.

The business distributes a wide range of bulk food products — including appetizers, beef, bread, breakfast items, canned goods, dairy, frozen foods, and pantry staples — along with janitorial supplies. It also offers consulting services for new or existing foodservice operations.

The company also sells directly to families and businesses stocking up on bulk groceries.

