UPDATE companies SET description='Bila Solar operates from Indianapolis, Indiana, where it manufactures high-performance solar panels. The company is led by industry veterans including President Wei-Tai Kwok, who brings 16 years of renewable energy executive experience, VP Sales Kyle Burak with 25-plus years in critical power infrastructure, Materials Manager Patrick Lennon, and Senior Accounting Manager Ed Reed.

The company produces 550-watt dual-glass photovoltaic modules using U.S.-made solar cells, positioning itself among the first to offer a domestically sourced cell in a high-output dual-glass format.

